## Unenforced Aspiration

Claims in this document **without** a paired `.spec.ts`, guard script, or CI workflow step. Each item references the section it came from. (R2 — Verification-as-Code.)

| § | Claim | Why unenforced |
|---|--------|----------------|
| Forensic Truth | “Dependency-free foundation closed” | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — trunk still builds Phases 1–3 packages via `phase-0:integration-gate` |
| Forensic Truth | SDK has only `@casl/ability` runtime dep (no theme/auth retrofit) | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — `src/auth/**`, `src/theme/**` exist; see `package.json` |
| §1 | Physical `legacy/` archive; `apps/` absent from product tree | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — `legacy/` + `apps/*` exist; **architecturally isolated** via [`legacy-import.contract.spec.ts`](../packages/workspace-sdk/test/legacy-import.contract.spec.ts) (foundation scope) + KS-01 gate split |
| §1 | “Enterprise-ready repo” one-liner | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — composite narrative, not a single assertion |
| §2 L-1 | Phase 0 = contract only; production in Phase 3+ | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — process / PR scope |
| §2 L-2 | No adapter delegate to legacy | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — no dedicated “delegate adapter” detector |
| §2 L-3 | Starter plugin shape vs mock | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — partially covered by starter tests; no “not mock” rule |
| §2 L-4 | No `@repo/types` / `TourFormProfile` | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — depcruise does not name legacy package ids |
| §2 L-5 | One sub-phase per PR | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — social contract only |
| §2 L-7 | platform-core before apps (ordering) | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — both exist in tree; integration gate builds both |
| §2 L-8 | Canonical sole SoT from Phase 3 UI | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — forward-looking; UI not in Phase 0 gate |
| §2 L-9 | No `DENALI_STRATEGY_PROFILES` in API core | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — apps/api not scanned in foundation-gate |
| §3 soft | MIGRATION-MAP / phase-1 doc files exist and stay linked | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — partial via `guard:doc-sync`; not full content audit |
| §4 | Sub-phase DAG ordering; no platform-core before 0.6 | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — merge policy, not CI |
| §5 | `git mv` history preserved; root has `apps/*` under Integration Foundation | **Enforced** — `legacy/apps/api` + REM-013 trunk |
| §6 | SDK without UI, Nest, Denali product code | **Partial** — depcruise + `denali-coupling.contract.spec.ts` |
| §6 | `resolveWorkspacePluginIdForType("denali") → null` until Phase 6 | **Enforced** — `denali-workspace-binding.contract.spec.ts` in `test:phase-0` |
| §8 | PR template always used with `Phase: 0.x` | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — `.github/pull_request_template.md` not executed in CI |
| §11 | Do not add `platform-core` / apps in Phase 0 PRs | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — PR policy; trunk may contain them |
| §11 | No `packages/workspaces/denali` | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — no denali workspace package test |
| §11 | No theme/design-token scaffold in Phase 0 | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — packages exist from later phases |
| §12 #8 | No open PRs outside Phase 0 scope | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — human process |
| §14 | Future MAP §5–§10 delivery | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — by design (out of Phase 0 scope) |
| §9.4 | Remote GitHub Actions green after push | <span style="color:#c00">**Aspirational**</span> — environment-dependent; verify both jobs (`Phase 0 foundation gate` + `Phase 0 integration gate`) manually after push |

