## 4. DAG و زیرفازها

### Verification

| Claim | Verification |
|-------|--------------|
| 0.5 CI gate exists before Phase 1 | [Verifies: `.github/workflows/phase-0-gate.yml`](../.github/workflows/phase-0-gate.yml) · [Verifies: `package.json`](../package.json) (`phase-0:foundation-gate`) |
| 0.6 baseline metrics | [Verifies: `scripts/guards/baseline-metrics.mjs`](../scripts/guards/baseline-metrics.mjs) — runs in `phase-0:integration-gate`; not in foundation-gate |
| Sub-phase = one PR; overlap rules | → [Unenforced Aspiration](#unenforced-aspiration) |

```text
0.1 legacy archive
    ↓
0.2 workspace-sdk + starter reference plugin
    ↓
0.3 dependency-cruiser rules
    ↓
0.4 docs (MIGRATION-MAP, phase-0, phase-1)
    ↓
0.5 CI phase-0-gate (push + PR)
    ↓
0.6 baseline metrics script (coupling score = 0 in new packages)
    ↓
→ Phase 1.1 platform-core scaffold
```

| Sub-phase | PR label | وابستگی |
|-----------|----------|---------|
| 0.1 | `Phase: 0.1` | — |
| 0.2 | `Phase: 0.2` | 0.1 |
| 0.3 | `Phase: 0.3` | 0.2 |
| 0.4 | `Phase: 0.4` | 0.1 |
| 0.5 | `Phase: 0.5` | 0.2, 0.3 |
| 0.6 | `Phase: 0.6` | 0.5 |

**Overlap مجاز:** 0.4 موازی 0.2–0.3 (فقط docs).  
**Overlap ممنوع:** شروع `platform-core` قبل از **0.6** سبز (شامل `baseline:metrics`).

