| Ingress hardening (BigInt, accessors, arrays) | [`invariant-manifest.contract.spec.ts`](../packages/workspace-sdk/test/invariant-manifest.contract.spec.ts) (manifest invariants) · extended adversarial specs → [Unenforced Aspiration](#unenforced-aspiration) (integration `pnpm test` only) |
