| Theme ingress / seal / CSS safety | [Verifies: `packages/workspace-sdk/src/theme/theme.spec.ts`](../packages/workspace-sdk/src/theme/theme.spec.ts) · [Verifies: `packages/workspace-sdk/src/theme/theme-safety-seal.spec.ts`](../packages/workspace-sdk/src/theme/theme-safety-seal.spec.ts) · [Verifies: `packages/workspace-sdk/src/theme/theme-css-value-safety.spec.ts`](../packages/workspace-sdk/src/theme/theme-css-value-safety.spec.ts) |
| Starter reference ↔ workspace-starter parity | [Verifies: `packages/workspaces/starter/test/sdk-reference-parity.spec.ts`](../packages/workspaces/starter/test/sdk-reference-parity.spec.ts) |
| `workspace-sdk` ↛ `workspaces/*` | [`legacy-import.contract.spec.ts`](../packages/workspace-sdk/test/legacy-import.contract.spec.ts) |
