## 9. زیرفاز 0.5 — CI gate فاز ۰

### Verification

| Claim | Verification |
|-------|--------------|
| **Zero-Debt Covenant** (foundation gate) | `pnpm run phase-0:foundation-gate` = `pnpm run test:phase-0` → [`phase-0.contract.spec.ts`](../packages/workspace-sdk/test/phase-0.contract.spec.ts) |
| Integration gate script chain | [Verifies: `package.json`](../package.json) (`phase-0:integration-gate` — includes `baseline:metrics`) |
| CI jobs (foundation + integration) | [Verifies: `.github/workflows/phase-0-gate.yml`](../.github/workflows/phase-0-gate.yml) |
| Node 24 engine check in CI | [Verifies: `scripts/guards/check-node-engine.mjs`](../scripts/guards/check-node-engine.mjs) (workflow step) |
| Guard report `phase-0-gate-*.json` | [Verifies: `scripts/guards/phase-0-guard.mjs`](../scripts/guards/phase-0-guard.mjs) (integration gate) |
| Baseline report `phase-0-baseline-*.json` | [Verifies: `scripts/guards/baseline-metrics.mjs`](../scripts/guards/baseline-metrics.mjs) (integration gate) |
| Supplementary guards (integration only) | `g4_depcruise_architecture` · `g4b_import_boundary` · `g7_doc_sync` (foundation scope) · `g6_runtime_deps_honesty` (full `pnpm run phase-0:guard` only) |
| Retired grep/count guards | g1 dist file · g2 rg denali · g3 rg legacy · g5 test count ≥103 — **replaced** by [`phase-0.contract.spec.ts`](../packages/workspace-sdk/test/phase-0.contract.spec.ts) covenant modules |
| Sub-guard env whitelist | [Verifies: `scripts/guards/lib/guard-subprocess-env.mjs`](../scripts/guards/lib/guard-subprocess-env.mjs) |
| Remote Actions green on push | → [Unenforced Aspiration](#unenforced-aspiration) (environment-dependent; checklist §9.4) |

### 9.1 هدف

جلوگیری از **L-6**: gate فقط محلی — main بدون حفاظت. **KS-01 (Gate Drift):** دو gate جدا — **foundation** برای بستن فاز ۰، **integration** برای یکپارچگی trunk.

### 9.2 Workflow (KS-01 split)

فایل: [`.github/workflows/phase-0-gate.yml`](../.github/workflows/phase-0-gate.yml) — دو job موازی:

| Job (CI name) | اسکریپت | نقش |
|---------------|---------|------|
| **Phase 0 foundation gate** | `pnpm run phase-0:foundation-gate` | **Phase 0 Closure** — تنها gate الزامی برای merge فاز ۰ |
| **Phase 0 integration gate** | `pnpm run phase-0:integration-gate` | **Trunk integrity** — build/test/guards کل monorepo (REM-013) |

**Scope Assert (H-04):** قبل از closure در job foundation، [`foundation-scope-assert.mjs`](../scripts/guards/foundation-scope-assert.mjs) تأیید می‌کند `phase-0:foundation-gate` **فقط** `pnpm run test:phase-0` است (بدون `guard:doc-sync`، `phase-0-guard`، یا root `pnpm build`). build/guard/doc-sync فقط در `phase-0:integration-gate`.

**Branch protection:** فقط job **`Phase 0 foundation gate`** را required کنید. integration gate سبز بودن trunk را گزارش می‌دهد؛ شکست آن **Phase 0 Closure** را ابطال نمی‌کند (مگر تیم trunk را هم required کند).

**Parity محلی:**

```bash
pnpm run phase-0:foundation-gate   # closure
pnpm run phase-0:integration-gate  # trunk
pnpm run phase-0:gate                # هر دو (ترتیبی)
```

**Pre-commit:** `pnpm run ci:integrity` → `phase-0:gate` (هر دو) + `guard:symlink` + `phase-1-guard` ([`ci-integrity-check.sh`](../scripts/ci-integrity-check.sh)).

#### 9.2.1 `phase-0:foundation-gate` (Zero-Debt Covenant)

| Step | دستور |
|------|--------|
| **closure only** | `pnpm run phase-0:foundation-gate` → `pnpm run test:phase-0` |

`test:phase-0` در `@app-tour/workspace-sdk`: `pnpm run build` + اجرای **تنها** [`phase-0.contract.spec.ts`](../packages/workspace-sdk/test/phase-0.contract.spec.ts) — subprocess **ده** ماژول covenant: `dist-surface` · `denali-coupling` · `legacy-import` · `invariant-manifest` · `import-purity` · `ingress-error` · `theme-safety-seal` · `foundation-import-purity` · `denali-workspace-binding` · `supplemental-behavior`.

**ممنوع در foundation-gate:** grep denali (g2)، test count floor (g5)، `test:adversarial`، `guard:doc-sync`، `phase-0-guard`.

Scope: [`foundation-gate-config.mjs`](../scripts/guards/foundation-gate-config.mjs).

#### 9.2.2 `phase-0:integration-gate`

| Step | دستور |
|------|--------|
| build + test | root `pnpm build` + `pnpm test` (همه packages + apps؛ شامل adversarial specs در SDK) |
| legacy (H-12) | `pnpm run test:contract:monorepo` — `legacy-import.contract.spec.ts` با `LEGACY_IMPORT_SCAN_SCOPE=monorepo` |
| adversarial | `pnpm run test:adversarial` |
| doc-sync | `DOC_SYNC_SCOPE=foundation` → `pnpm run guard:doc-sync` |
| supplementary | `PHASE_0_GUARD_SCOPE=foundation` → `phase-0-guard.mjs` (scoped depcruise + import-boundary + doc-sync check) |
| guards | `guard:architecture` + `guard:import-boundary` (full `IMPORT_BOUNDARY_SCAN_ROOTS`) |
| baseline (0.6) | `pnpm run baseline:metrics` — coupling contracts t2/t3 + `reports/phase-0-baseline-*.json` |

گزارش: `reports/phase-0-foundation-gate-*.json` (foundation guard scope) · `reports/phase-0-gate-*.json` (full guard) · `reports/phase-0-baseline-*.json`.

### 9.3 Zero-Debt Covenant vs supplementary guards

**Closure (H-06 / KS-01):** `pnpm run phase-0:foundation-gate` = `pnpm run test:phase-0` = [`phase-0.contract.spec.ts`](../packages/workspace-sdk/test/phase-0.contract.spec.ts) — **هیچ** guard یا doc-sync دیگری.

**Supplementary** (integration-gate only): `PHASE_0_GUARD_SCOPE=foundation` → scoped depcruise/import-boundary؛ `guard:doc-sync` — **جایگزین** aggregator نیستند.

### Verification Table (foundation gate — H-11 / Zero-Debt Covenant)

| Requirement claim | Verification | Truth rating | Risk class |
|-------------------|--------------|--------------|------------|
| **Zero-Debt Covenant (aggregator)** | `pnpm run test:phase-0` → [`phase-0.contract.spec.ts`](../packages/workspace-sdk/test/phase-0.contract.spec.ts) | **Verified** | Closure |
| Dist publish surface | [`contract.spec.ts`](../packages/workspace-sdk/test/contract.spec.ts) (via aggregator) | **Verified** | Export surface |
| **Denali coupling** | [`denali-coupling.contract.spec.ts`](../packages/workspace-sdk/test/denali-coupling.contract.spec.ts) — depcruise `no-denali-product-ids` (not grep/g2) | **Verified** | Coupling |
| **Legacy import** | [`legacy-import.contract.spec.ts`](../packages/workspace-sdk/test/legacy-import.contract.spec.ts) — foundation scope in aggregator; monorepo via `test:contract:monorepo` in integration | **Verified** | Coupling |
| **Manifest invariants** | [`invariant-manifest.contract.spec.ts`](../packages/workspace-sdk/test/invariant-manifest.contract.spec.ts) | **Verified** | Security |
| **Import purity** | [`import-purity.spec.ts`](../packages/workspace-sdk/test/import-purity.spec.ts) | **Verified** | Purity |
| **Ingress error taxonomy** | [`ingress-error.contract.spec.ts`](../packages/workspace-sdk/test/ingress-error.contract.spec.ts) | **Verified** | Error handling |
| **Denali workspace binding** | [`denali-workspace-binding.contract.spec.ts`](../packages/workspace-sdk/test/denali-workspace-binding.contract.spec.ts) (via aggregator) | **Verified** | Binding |
